@base_url = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@recording_id = replace-after-upload
@task_id = replace-after-upload

### Upload one audio file (wav/mp3/m4a/aac, <= 50 MiB)
POST {{base_url}}/v1/recordings
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=RecordingBoundary

--RecordingBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="meeting.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

mock audio bytes for API validation
--RecordingBoundary--

### Task status
GET {{base_url}}/v1/tasks/{{task_id}}

### Paginated recordings (newest first)
GET {{base_url}}/v1/recordings?page=1&page_size=20

### Recording detail
GET {{base_url}}/v1/recordings/{{recording_id}}

### Retry only after the task is failed
POST {{base_url}}/v1/tasks/{{task_id}}/retry

### Delete recording and associated tasks/file
DELETE {{base_url}}/v1/recordings/{{recording_id}}
